{"en":{"stem":"A certain system has a state space model as\n[Ẋ_1 ; Ẋ_2] = [−2 −3 ; 4 2][X_1 ; X_2] + [3 ; 5]U\nY = [1 1][X_1 ; X_2], D = 0\nWhat will be the transfer function of this system?","options":["(8s + 1)/(s^2 + 8)","(s + 8)/(s^2 + 8)","(2s + 1)/(s^2 + 8)","(s + 2)/(s^2 + 8)"],"quick":"Use G(s)=C(sI−A)^−1B+D. Here det(sI−A)=s^2+8. Multiplying C·adj(sI−A)·B gives 8s+1; therefore G(s)=(8s+1)/(s^2+8).","formula":["[Ẋ1 ; Ẋ2] = [−2  −3 ; 4  2][X1 ; X2] + [3 ; 5]U","Y = [1  1][X1 ; X2],  D = 0","G(s) = C(sI − A)−1B + D","sI − A = [s + 2   3 ; −4   s − 2]","det(sI − A) = (s + 2)(s − 2) − 3(−4) = s² + 8","(sI − A)−1 = adj(sI − A)/(s² + 8)","A = [−2  −3 ; 4  2]","B = [3 ; 5]","C = [1  1]","D = 0","G(s) = C(sI − A)−1B + D","sI = [s  0 ; 0  s]","sI − A = [s + 2   3 ; −4   s − 2]","det(sI − A) = (s + 2)(s − 2) − (3)(−4)","det(sI − A) = s² − 4 + 12","det(sI − A) = s² + 8","adj(sI − A) = [s − 2   −3 ; 4   s + 2]","(sI − A)−1 = [s − 2   −3 ; 4   s + 2]/(s² + 8)","[s − 2   −3 ; 4   s + 2][3 ; 5]","= [3(s − 2) − 15 ; 12 + 5(s + 2)]","= [3s − 21 ; 5s + 22]","C·adj(sI − A)·B = [1  1][3s − 21 ; 5s + 22]","= (3s − 21) + (5s + 22)","= 8s + 1","G(s) = (8s + 1)/(s² + 8) + 0","Characteristic polynomial = det(sI − A) = s² + 8","All four options have denominator s² + 8"]},"hi":{"stem":"किसी सिस्टम का स्टेट-स्पेस मॉडल है:\n[Ẋ_1 ; Ẋ_2] = [−2 −3 ; 4 2][X_1 ; X_2] + [3 ; 5]U\nY = [1 1][X_1 ; X_2], D = 0\nइस सिस्टम का ट्रांसफर फंक्शन क्या होगा?","options":["(8s + 1)/(s^2 + 8)","(s + 8)/(s^2 + 8)","(2s + 1)/(s^2 + 8)","(s + 2)/(s^2 + 8)"],"quick":"G(s)=C(sI−A)^−1B+D का उपयोग करें। यहाँ det(sI−A)=s^2+8। C·adj(sI−A)·B का गुणन 8s+1 देता है; अतः G(s)=(8s+1)/(s^2+8)।"},"gu":{"stem":"કોઈ સિસ્ટમનું સ્ટેટ-સ્પેસ મોડેલ છે:\n[Ẋ_1 ; Ẋ_2] = [−2 −3 ; 4 2][X_1 ; X_2] + [3 ; 5]U\nY = [1 1][X_1 ; X_2], D = 0\nઆ સિસ્ટમનું ટ્રાન્સફર ફંક્શન શું થશે?","options":["(8s + 1)/(s^2 + 8)","(s + 8)/(s^2 + 8)","(2s + 1)/(s^2 + 8)","(s + 2)/(s^2 + 8)"],"quick":"G(s)=C(sI−A)^−1B+D નો ઉપયોગ કરો. અહીં det(sI−A)=s^2+8. C·adj(sI−A)·B નો ગુણાકાર 8s+1 આપે છે; તેથી G(s)=(8s+1)/(s^2+8)."}}